# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.suspendtest).
# The suspension the /var/jb/var/mobile link was for: Wi-Fi joined by the scene, Sileo opened,
# sent to the background twice and opened again each time. With the containers on the real
# /var/mobile, runningboardd should suspend it (no 0xdead10cc) and the next open should be a warm
# resume, not a cold launch. The runner is devices/thyme/launchtest.sh
# (SCENE=out/thyme-boot/root-suspendtest.apfs), a screenshot every two seconds; the last
# background and open are timed to land in the log's kept tail.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 6
/redwood/bin/net_test joinfile /redwood/fw/network
/redwood/bin/net_test waitaddr en0 60 resolve apt.procurs.us
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 button home wait 25
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 100 button home wait 20
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 40
